  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Desira Lift+</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The objective of DeSIRA LIFT+ is to support the DeSIRA+ initiative for better coherence and synergies of the DeSIRA+ interventions by (i) fostering dialogue among the implementers, partners and policy makers, (ii) providing tailored services and (iii) producing actionable knowledge for innovation at scale in line with agroecological principles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;CRIS : &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cc.cec/cris/saisie/visa/visas_frame.cfm?FKEY_NSQ=489219&amp;ENTT_COD=PORD&amp;amp;WKHD_NUM=0&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: blue;&quot;&gt;NDICI AFRICA/2025/489-219&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
